					},
					"body": "The idea is OK, it works, but I still don't like the technical side: Still too much code duplication and double-evaluation.\nStill, might find resonance - or we'll forget it.\n\n- Load [Test missing cities.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/33938817/Test.missing.cities.zip)\n- Open your capital's CityScreen\n- Select Circus Maximus on the left\n- Right side shows there's cities missing a Collisioneum - and a button\n- Click button - as there's more than one, it uses the good old \"one time notification\" with LocationActions to show which cities\n- Buy one Colluseum and retry button - it jumps directly to the single city missing the other\n\nNot that helpful in that fabricated tiny game, but can be quite nice in large games.\n",
